  "description_en": "Obtains the registration code of a specific certificate authority (CA) certificate. When you register a CA certificate with an ApsaraMQ for MQTT broker, you must upload the validation certificate of the CA certificate to verify whether you have the private key of the CA certificate. The validation certificate of a CA certificate must be generated by using the registration code of the CA certificate",
